			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 3720
			},
			"text": " What would happen if the Earth and all terrestrial objects suddenly stopped spinning, but the"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:03,720",
				"to": "00:00:05,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 3720,
				"to": 5880
			},
			"text": " atmosphere retained its velocity?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:05,880",
				"to": "00:00:08,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 5880,
				"to": 8280
			},
			"text": " At the equator, things would get really weird."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:08,280",
				"to": "00:00:11,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 8280,
				"to": 11600
			},
			"text": " Wind sweeping over the oceans would have been churning up and atomizing the surface layer"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:11,600",
				"to": "00:00:12,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 11600,
				"to": 12600
			},
			"text": " of the water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:12,600",
				"to": "00:00:15,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 12600,
				"to": 15220
			},
			"text": " For a while, the ocean would cease to have a surface at all."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,220",
				"to": "00:00:18,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15220,
				"to": 18960
			},
			"text": " As the energy of the blasting wind began to dissipate, it would mostly go into heat."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:18,960",
				"to": "00:00:20,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 18960,
				"to": 20240
			},
			"text": " A lot of heat."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:20,240",
				"to": "00:00:21,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 20240,
				"to": 21440
			},
			"text": " But oceans are cold."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,440",
				"to": "00:00:25,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21440,
				"to": 25680
			},
			"text": " The subsequent turbulent mixing would likely trigger worldwide thunderstorms over the oceans."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:25,680",
				"to": "00:00:29,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 25680,
				"to": 29080
			},
			"text": " The wind would also have momentum, which would transfer into waves which would sweep around"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,080",
				"to": "00:00:33,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29080,
				"to": 33320
			},
			"text": " the globe, west to east, and every west-facing shore would encounter the largest storm surge"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:33,320",
				"to": "00:00:34,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 33320,
				"to": 34480
			},
			"text": " in world history."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:34,480",
				"to": "00:00:38,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 34480,
				"to": 38720
			},
			"text": " Eventually, a dense blanket of fog would settle over the cold ocean surfaces."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:38,720",
				"to": "00:00:42,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 38720,
				"to": 42240
			},
			"text": " If the Earth stopped spinning completely, the normal cycles of day and night would end."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,240",
				"to": "00:00:46,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42240,
				"to": 46300
			},
			"text": " The sun wouldn't completely stop moving across the sky, but it would slow down a lot."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:46,300",
				"to": "00:00:49,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 46300,
				"to": 49440
			},
			"text": " As the Earth's orbit carried us in a circle, we would see the sun rise and set exactly"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:49,440",
				"to": "00:00:50,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 49440,
				"to": 50440
			},
			"text": " once a year."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,440",
				"to": "00:00:52,460"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50440,
				"to": 52460
			},
			"text": " Well, not exactly once a year."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:52,460",
				"to": "00:00:55,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 52460,
				"to": 55840
			},
			"text": " The momentum of the atmospheric winds would get transferred back to the Earth, starting"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:55,840",
				"to": "00:01:00,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 55840,
				"to": 60000
			},
			"text": " at spinning again very slowly, since the atmosphere is much lighter than the Earth."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:00,000",
				"to": "00:01:04,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 60000,
				"to": 64480
			},
			"text": " Relative to the distant stars, a single spin of the Earth would now take around 3,000 years"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
